---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — al-Nizam"
  description="How al-nizam.ai handles visitor data."
  theme="light"
>
  <PageHeader kicker="al-Nizam" title="Privacy" />

  <article>
    <p class="lead">
      al-nizam.ai is a static, informational site about the al-Nizam framework.
      It collects as little as possible.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <p>
      There are no accounts, no sign-in, and no marketing or advertising
      cookies on this site. You can read everything here without being tracked
      across the web.
    </p>

    <p>
      The site is served through Cloudflare, which — like any web host — may
      record standard request metadata (such as IP address, browser type, and
      timestamp) for security, abuse prevention, and reliable delivery. That
      data is not used to build a profile of you, and it is never sold or
      shared for marketing.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you choose to contact us, we keep only what you send, and only for as
      long as it takes to respond.
    </p>

    <p>
      A complete, formal privacy policy will be published here as al-Nizam's
      commercial offerings come online and the data we handle expands. Until
      then, this page reflects current practice honestly: minimal collection,
      no tracking, no resale.
    </p>

    <p>
      Questions about privacy? See <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
